# Keep secrets and local files out of the build context: everything is left out except what the Dockerfile copies. A list
# of what is allowed is safer than a list of what is not, because a new local file is left out without being named here.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!chat_with_any_website_agent/

# Not needed inside the package
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
